# week07 · LJ 유체 템플릿 — 자리표시 1.0 11 0.005 1000 는 render_inputs.py 가 채운다 (run_id = T10_s11)
units lj
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 0.8
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0
velocity all create 1.0 11 dist gaussian
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
neighbor 0.3 bin
fix 1 all nvt temp 1.0 1.0 0.5
timestep 0.005
thermo 50
thermo_style custom step temp press pe etotal
run 1000
write_data final_T10_s11.data
